---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Contact — Litia">
  <h1 class="pageTitle">Connect With Litia</h1>
  <p class="subtle">Tell us about your learners, setting, and goals. We respond as soon as possible.</p>
  <br />
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Email: <a href="mailto:litialearning@gmail.com">litialearning@gmail.com</a></li>
    </ul>
    <br />
    <h2>What to include in correspondence</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name and role (parent, educator, researcher, educational institution, or partner).</li>
      <li>Devices you use (iPad or iPhone with TrueDepth front camera).</li>
      <li>Needs or desires with Litia. These may include partnership/pricing inquiries, learning outcome data, journalistic/technical information requests, or privacy/terms of service questions.</li>
      <li>Timeline for a pilot or partnership (if desired).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We are happy to help however we can. We are not, however, able to share confidential information about our software or usage unless required by law. Please be specific in your request and we will get back to you quickly.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
